  "name": "Suicideboys Style - Dark Ghost Tune",
  "created": "2026-10-18T00:00:00Z",
  "app": "0.2.0",
  "description": "Dark, washed-out underground/phonk vocal - CLEAR + LOUD version: medium autotune (25 ms), ghostly detuned double and faint octave-down shadow kept behind the voice, mud cut and presence boosted so every word is understandable, warm tape grit, light haze, slapback and dark mist. Extra compression and +4 dB into the limiter (ceiling -1 dB) make it loud without clipping.",
